      "changelog": "\n<details>\n<summary>Testing wanted</summary>\n\nI'm currently working on a script that should improve loading times significantly for Mellow. I plan to use it by default in the next version, but I need to know it works correctly. Please see [here](https://modrinth.com/shader/mellow/version/3.4b) if you're interested.\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n- Added floodfill based colored lighting\n- Added an option for double layered clouds\n- Improve handling of PBR metals (especially underground)\n- Fix night vision only applying underground\n- Make POM work on hand items & entities\n- Add colored shadows option\n- Fix blocky clouds breaking on some hardware\n- Fix dynamic shadows when the sun angle is 0\n- Many other bugfixes",
